# 📚 Referensi Buku Teks Matematika

## Aljabar & Linear Algebra
1. **"Linear Algebra Done Right"** - Sheldon Axler
   - Level: Universitas
   - Fokus: Pendekatan konseptual
   - Link: [Springer](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-031-41026-0)

2. **"Algebra"** - Michael Artin
   - Level: Lanjutan
